# After the opponent attacks with Turtle, Old Man takes it that turn; its new controller may attack with it next turn because it did not attack on that player's last turn (CR 508.1c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Old Man of the Sea
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Giant Turtle
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Old Man of the Sea.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Giant Turtle.Cast
? Bot2.Mana =
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Giant Turtle > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Giant Turtle)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Giant Turtle > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Giant Turtle.Tapped = true
